    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000026
    m_Localized: Enter ghost penetration state, destroy overlapping blocks on hard
      drop and fire missiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000027
    m_Localized: Clear the top block of each column and fire missiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000028
    m_Localized: Fill closed gaps and check for clears
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000029
    m_Localized: Unavailable, obtain one Tactical Expansion to unlock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000030
    m_Localized: Unavailable, obtain two Tactical Expansions to unlock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000031
    m_Localized: Unavailable, obtain three Tactical Expansions to unlock
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000032
    m_Localized: Blocks take damage within 0.2 seconds after generation will trigger
      counter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000033
    m_Localized: When grid overflows, consume {0} CP, release accumulated charge
      of impact cannon to damage enemies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000034
    m_Localized: If CP is insufficient, own HP becomes 1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000035
    m_Localized: Releasing impact cannon and using active skills consume CP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000036
    m_Localized: Number of storable block slots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000037
    m_Localized: Now clearing blocks will generate {0} missiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000038
    m_Localized: Blocks can now withstand {0} missiles
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000039
    m_Localized: 'Press 1 to phase through blocks.Press Space to wipe out overlaps
      and launch missiles. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000040
    m_Localized: Press 2 to clear the top block of each row and generate missiles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000041
    m_Localized: 'Press 3 to fill all enclosed areas with blocks.Completed rows count
      as valid clears. Clearing void blocks generates no missiles. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000042
    m_Localized: Tactical Expansion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000043
    m_Localized: Fortify Defense
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000044
    m_Localized: Double Firepower
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000045
    m_Localized: Lv{0} -> Lv{1}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000046
    m_Localized: Boss Battle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000047
    m_Localized: Project Selection
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000048
    m_Localized: Bonus Enhance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000049
    m_Localized: Void Nullify!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000050
    m_Localized: Castle Damaged
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000051
    m_Localized: Normal Bullet
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000052
    m_Localized: Area Damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000053
    m_Localized: Add Block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000054
    m_Localized: Explosive Block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000055
    m_Localized: Insert Garbage Row
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000056
    m_Localized: Insert Void Row
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000057
    m_Localized: Corrupt Explosive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000058
    m_Localized: Corrupt Void
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000059
    m_Localized: Deals damage to the hit block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000060
    m_Localized: Deals damage to blocks in a 3x3 area centered on the hit block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000061
    m_Localized: Deals damage to the hit block and adds a garbage block above it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000062
    m_Localized: Deals damage to the hit block and adds an explosive block above
      it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000063
    m_Localized: Deals damage to the hit block and inserts a full row of garbage
      blocks from the bottom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000064
    m_Localized: Deals damage to the hit block and inserts a full row of void blocks
      from the bottom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000065
    m_Localized: Deals damage to the hit block and randomly corrupts one cell of
      the next piece into an explosive block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000066
    m_Localized: Deals damage to the hit block and randomly corrupts one cell of
      the next piece into a void block
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000067
    m_Localized: None
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000068
    m_Localized: Enemy will not fire any bullets
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000069
    m_Localized: '[Legendary Enhancement]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6700000000070
    m_Localized: 'Attack Interval:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000001
    m_Localized: You don't need to place blocks immediately. Observing the battlefield
      is also crucial.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000002
    m_Localized: Different types of projects have different level caps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000003
    m_Localized: Do not counter area damage with Corrupt Explosive blocks, or face
      the consequences.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000004
    m_Localized: Counter also counts as a Combo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000005
    m_Localized: Block overflow has a cost. If you cannot pay it, you will become
      extremely vulnerable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000006
    m_Localized: Double Firepower turns pure quantity into a qualitative shift. Fear
      comes from insufficient firepower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000007
    m_Localized: "When necessary, overflow the grid to wipe the battlefield\u2014and
      unleash a massive strike."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000008
    m_Localized: Sometimes overflowing the grid is the best way to clean the field
      and hit the monster hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000009
    m_Localized: Use enemy attacks to help remove Void blocks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000010
    m_Localized: If Void blocks prevent you from attacking, try relying on Counter
      instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000011
    m_Localized: If area damage hits Garbage Rows, the castle will take double damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000012
    m_Localized: "If you manage to unlock Repair, you're in luck\u2014it allows you
      to punish the monster severely."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000013
    m_Localized: Some gunners use Erase to evade Corrupt blocks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000014
    m_Localized: You can keep countering, but the battlefield will become chaotic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000015
    m_Localized: You can keep rotating blocks to stall the battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000016
    m_Localized: Hard drop blocks into bullet paths to trigger Counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000017
    m_Localized: If Garbage Row blocks take damage, the castle will be damaged directly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000018
    m_Localized: Garbage Rows can only be removed by completing full rows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000019
    m_Localized: Space Expansion unlocks storage slots for keys S, D, and F.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000020
    m_Localized: Press A to store the current block or swap it with a stored one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000021
    m_Localized: Clearing Void blocks will disable your attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000022
    m_Localized: If available, using Erase or Execute to remove unwanted blocks is
      a viable strategy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000023
    m_Localized: Use Erase to avoid Corrupt blocks when possible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000024
    m_Localized: Erase, Execute, and Repair may prevent you from paying overflow
      costs, leaving you vulnerable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000025
    m_Localized: Wait for enemies to fill gaps using Add Block bullets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000026
    m_Localized: Void Garbage Rows will completely block your normal attacks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000027
    m_Localized: In Legendary Projects, Tactical Expansion unlocks Erase at level
      1, Execute at level 2, and Repair at level 3.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000028
    m_Localized: Legendary Projects include Fortify Defense, Double Firepower, and
      Tactical Expansion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000029
    m_Localized: Legendary Projects are obtained by fully upgrading a project.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000030
    m_Localized: After overflowing the grid, regroup on a clean battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000031
    m_Localized: Try using Counter to block incoming area bullets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000032
    m_Localized: Both Salvo (multi-row clears) and Combo (consecutive clears) deal
      extra damage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000033
    m_Localized: "Hang on\u2014your current charge may be useful later."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000034
    m_Localized: Area bullets will destroy all blocks in a 3x3 area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000035
    m_Localized: 'Remember: this is a battlefield between gunners and monsters, not
      a puzzle game.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000036
    m_Localized: Be cautious when dealing with combinations of area damage and explosive
      blocks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000037
    m_Localized: Fortify Defense may seem modest, but it can fundamentally change
      the battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000038
    m_Localized: CP is restored at the start of each battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000039
    m_Localized: If an Explosive Block is destroyed by enemy attacks, the castle
      will be damaged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6800000000040
    m_Localized: Will this attack devastate your blocks? Use Execute to intercept
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
